
=== Export

Export your configuration at any time through the web console. Open the Configure tab, then click the Details tab. On the Overview screen you there is an [export] button. Use the drop down to select the format you would like to use for the export.


Exporting your configuration might be useful in order to save a configuration in source control or to be used as an import 
into another environment.  Export and Import are frequently used to migrate configuration between test and production environments.


Consider setting the topbar.system.text=YOUR_ENRIONMENT_NAME parameter in the engine properties file to help visually separate environments with identical configuration.

